          ha_GRAPH -->|New missing decision| ha_Q
        end
        subgraph ha_EXEC["4 · Do the work and verify the combined feature"]
          ha_ELIG{"Task prerequisites, human steps, authority,<br/>budget and compatible contract versions ready?"}
          ha_HOLD["Record reason and owner · wait only affected work"]
          ha_ASSIGN["Phase 0 foundation first, then feature waves<br/>Crew size and model level computed per wave; reserve resources and lease"]
