          ha_AUDIT["Static audit: no stubs, TODOs, swallowed errors,<br/>hard-coded data or test tampering"]
          ha_NEED["Missing context goes to original task author or successor<br/>Fetch verified handoff or queue a real product question"]
          ha_VERIFY["Independent verifier runs protected expectations<br/>on a clean candidate with fresh fixtures and current lease"]
          ha_INT["Feature integrator (the plan author's role) squashes passing tasks<br/>One wiring task wires real entry points; combined user journey runs"]
          ha_MERGE["Project merge queue checks current target<br/>Accept result and release dependents only on verified success"]
