          ha_WORK -->|Specific gap| ha_NEED
          ha_NEED -->|Known evidence| ha_WORK
          ha_NEED -->|Material decision missing| ha_Q
          ha_VERIFY -->|Independent checks pass| ha_INT --> ha_MERGE
          ha_VERIFY -->|Fail or no required checks ran| ha_FIX
          ha_INT -->|Broken seam or journey| ha_FIX
          ha_MERGE -->|Combined candidate fails| ha_FIX
          ha_FIX -->|Revised authorized brief or repair| ha_ELIG
        end
        subgraph ha_STEER["5 · Change direction while work continues"]
          ha_ROUTE["Bounded lookup in two linked graphs<br/>Small model proposes target and intent; code checks current ownership"]
