        on_PLAN["Pick a plan provider. Every tile says what it spends<br/>A plan is not an API key. ChatGPT, Copilot, Cursor<br/>and Gemini CLI spend that plan's allowance. Claude: API key only<br/>OpenRouter and pasted keys spend per token<br/>Plus is about 11 to 14 times API-equivalent. An estimate, not a quota"]
