        on_GUARD --> on_SETTINGS["Settings: label, account, status, what it spends,<br/>this week's use, roles. Add, test, rename, reconnect,<br/>rotate, edit limits, disable, remove, reorder fallback.<br/>The same provider may appear twice. Roster edits hit new attempts only"]
        on_SETTINGS --> on_DIST["Ships first as an open-source app that runs locally<br/>ChatGPT plan use is self-serve. A paid or hosted edition<br/>needs OpenAI's interest form. Gemini CLI ships in v1,<br/>off by default, with a policy warning. The Claude plan route is withdrawn<br/>Routes live in a versioned provider policy file"]
