        on_EV --> on_POL["The kernel matches events to the brief. No watching model<br/>Allow only the brief's path globs and the command list<br/>Deny push, branch switches, reset --hard, network installers,<br/>deletes outside the worktree, vault paths and credential files<br/>Stop at the reservation, the time cap, a repeated identical call,<br/>or the same failing command three times<br/>Silence for the stall window: interrupt, checkpoint, possibly stuck<br/>Defense in depth: their sandbox, our answers, the Job Object, then the diff"]
        on_POL --> on_MCP["ACP or the native protocol is how we control them<br/>A per-attempt MCP server is how they talk to us:<br/>get_brief, read_result, ask_owner, dispute_test,<br/>report_progress, request_dependency, submit_candidate"]
        on_OURS --> on_DIFF
