        on_DIFF --> on_VER["Clean verifier runs the locked checks, including a held-back case<br/>The agent's own 'tests passed' does not count"]
        on_VER -.-> on_JUDGE["When our side needs a judgment: one structured turn,<br/>tools off, a JSON schema, validated like any other output"]
        on_THEIRS --> on_EX["One Copilot task, as specified<br/>1 Worktree, brief, copilot --acp, harness MCP<br/>2 Send the brief. plan.updated is display only<br/>3 In-scope write: allow. curl piped to sh: deny and record<br/>4 ask_owner: the task author answers from the record<br/>5 submit_candidate: snapshot the diff<br/>6 Verifier pass accepts and unlocks dependents"]
        on_VER --> on_RES["One reservation rule for two currencies<br/>Project, feature, task, attempt<br/>usd, allowance for that connection, optional local slots<br/>Must fit every ancestor, in one SQLite transaction"]
