        on_EST --> on_AIMD["One controller per plan connection, in the global broker,<br/>because projects share plans. Grant, deposit, reserve, dispatch. AIMD from TCP:<br/>start at 2, add one after clean turns, halve on throttle,<br/>wait for the retry hint. User cap and plan-tier cap apply<br/>Burn rate: remaining share divided by time until reset<br/>If the share would run out early, slow that connection,<br/>move junior tasks, and show the new ETA"]
