        on_CONF --> on_EDGE["Refresh fails, or the user disconnects the app: hold that<br/>connection, show Reconnect, keep the others running<br/>Pro downgraded to Plus: the five-hour window applies<br/>Same plan also in chat: leave headroom, trust the limit error<br/>Two machines: warn that the estimate may be low<br/>Model gone: fall back and note it. Outage: re-route only<br/>within the allowed tier and spend type. 401: rotate the key<br/>A policy change disables the route and parks its tasks"]
