        dc_LAY["Chat on the left. Canvas on the right. Divider drags<br/>The canvas can pop out. Tabs: Architecture, Plan, Tasks, App, Diff<br/>Every box is a real node with a stable id. No second diagram state<br/>React Flow, ELK layout. Dragged positions are kept<br/>Mermaid export is the shareable text view<br/>The canvas is not generated from Mermaid"] --> dc_MIC["Mic fills an editable draft. Nothing is sent until Send<br/>Local Whisper by default. OS recognizer as fallback. Zero tokens<br/>Web Speech is not the default: Chrome sends audio to Google,<br/>and it is unreliable in Electron. Cloud transcription is not the default<br/>A ChatGPT plan token does not cover the transcription API<br/>Grey while a phrase is unstable, black when it is final<br/>3 seconds: still listening. 60 seconds: mic off, draft saved<br/>Numbers, times, money, names and negations: amber if unsure,<br/>with alternatives on hover. 'Scratch that' stays as spoken<br/>Optional one-click strike-through. The resolver, after Send,<br/>reads the whole message, including the retraction"]
