        cg_STATE["DRAFTED, READY, LEASED, CODING, then STATIC_AUDIT, then clean verify<br/>A static failure returns to coding. It is not a verification attempt<br/>The same fingerprint three times escalates like any loop"] --> cg_AUDIT["Deterministic scans on the diff. Seconds. No tokens. Shown to the worker<br/>TODO, FIXME, stubs, empty catch, dead controls, hard-coded records,<br/>fake names outside fixtures, mock imports in product code<br/>Edits to protected tests, skip or only, ts-ignore, as any, eslint-disable<br/>Unreachable files, unused planned fields, missing contract surface<br/>Elision placeholders, unplanned large deletions, out of scope, secrets<br/>A real deferral is TODO of an approved ID, and it appears in the final report<br/>Seeds, fixtures and declared generated paths are excluded<br/>A language with weak AST still gets text and type scans, and says so"]
