        ui_ASK["Web frontend pack. Every question has a recommended answer,<br/>so Accept all works<br/>A reference site: none, use a clean neutral<br/>Brand: slate, with one indigo accent. Density: balanced<br/>Theme: both, following the system. Font: the system stack<br/>Kit: shadcn/ui on Tailwind, source copied into the repo<br/>An existing repo extracts Tailwind, CSS variables and the<br/>component folder, and shows them for confirmation instead of asking"] --> ui_TOK["Phase 0, before any screen worker<br/>tokens.json, W3C design tokens. Color roles, six type steps,<br/>4 px spacing, radii, shadows, motion. Light and dark<br/>CSS variables and the Tailwind theme are generated, not hand-edited"]
