        is_ASK -->|Code only. Recommended| is_CODE["Types, files and functions. Tables and routes stay"]
        is_ASK -->|Code and database| is_DATA["Plus expand-then-contract"]
        is_ASK -->|Code, database and public API| is_ALIAS["Old routes stay as aliases for a deprecation period"]
        is_CODE --> is_STEPS
        is_DATA --> is_STEPS
        is_ALIAS --> is_STEPS["1 Read-only research: guide, changelog, known codemods<br/>2 Official codemod, language-service rename, ts-morph, ast-grep<br/>or jscodeshift. A model may write a script that is reviewed, then run<br/>3 Checklist: type errors, tests, lint, and string hits<br/>4 Residual fixes in dependency order. One commit per batch<br/>5 Type check, full suite, journeys, leftover scan<br/>6 Senior review of the non-mechanical diff<br/>Cannot submit while an error, a failing test or an unallowlisted leftover remains<br/>Parallel only when partitions are disjoint and each compiles alone"]
        is_STEPS --> is_RISK["1 Symptom patches are flagged. Two regression tests<br/>2 Bisect only a stable fingerprint. Exit 125 skips a broken commit<br/>Fresh sandbox per step. Confirm by reverting on current code<br/>3 Search every name form, including strings, SQL, config and docs<br/>Persisted names are keep or migrate, never a silent rename<br/>4 All-or-nothing leases. Intent mode. Tasks do not wait while holding<br/>Overlapping sweeps are serialized<br/>5 Packets fit the model. Hunks, not whole-file rewrites<br/>Elision placeholders are refused<br/>6 Behavior-preserving sweeps record characterization tests first<br/>AST flags await, defaults, ?? versus or, equality and timeouts<br/>7 Start from latest integration. Land in stages. Recompute the checklist<br/>after merging. Schema changes take the schema lease<br/>8 Workers never write the knowledge database. One test database per attempt<br/>Retry from a fresh worktree and database. Sweeps resume from the last batch<br/>9 Several projects share one broker, with an interactive lane<br/>10 SQLite is inside the app. The CLI is optional and read-only<br/>A foreign commit is seen via data_version, then integrity check and safe mode"]
        is_RISK --> is_EDGE["Cannot reproduce: stay open, with the hypothesis log<br/>Cause is a dependency: upgrade, patch or workaround, with the upstream link<br/>The report is a missing feature: send it to discovery<br/>No compatible library version: stop, and offer pin, replace or wait<br/>The developer edits during a sweep: merge, then recompute the checklist"]
