        kd_SAFE -->|Disk or I/O error| kd_MODE["Roll back. Safe mode: stop dispatch, keep worktrees and checkpoints"]
        kd_SAFE -->|Someone else committed, sqlite3 included| kd_FOREIGN["data_version changed. Integrity check, then safe mode"]
