        kd_FOREIGN --> kd_VER["Record version and content hash. Edge-set version. History is immutable<br/>Global revision labels snapshots and exports. It does not decide freshness<br/>A change set stores origin, what it read, old and new versions, and a class<br/>Cosmetic: non-normative prose. Clarifying: consistent detail, owner plus gate<br/>Compatible: structured diff. Breaking: value, removal, or unmarked normative text"]
        kd_VER --> kd_CLASS{"Class, for each dependent"}
        kd_CLASS -->|Cosmetic| kd_COS["Regenerate the view. Tasks are left alone"]
        kd_CLASS -->|Clarifying or compatible| kd_COMPAT["Not started: refresh the brief<br/>Running: a steer at the next boundary<br/>Submitted: verify on current checks<br/>Accepted: re-verify. A new receipt if it still passes"]
        kd_CLASS -->|Breaking| kd_BRK["Not started: refresh, and the planner reviews scope<br/>Running: hold, refresh, resume or a fresh session<br/>Submitted: verify on the new checks after the planner updates them<br/>Accepted: re-verify. Rework only if a check fails, or new behavior has no task"]
        kd_COS --> kd_CUT
